WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 0.1 · Start Here: Your Organisation Journey
How this course works

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Work in order: each course builds on decisions made in the one before.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Find the module you need most right now.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check which earlier decisions it depends on.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Set a learning rhythm you can actually keep.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Module 03 Governance: trustees need to see how shop profits reach the charity. It depends on our mission and objectives first.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your priority module, its dependencies and your rhythm.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
